# Rain and its events are about the land, not the camera (Q3-03): looking away from a shower
# that still falls on the corner brings neither the rainbow nor the after-rain birdsong.
set season summer
set clock day
set weather natural
set shower now
set camera 30 30 1
fast 400 raining yes
fast 70
expect raining yes
set camera 0 0 1
wait 3
expect raining no
expect event rainbow no
expect event chorus no
set camera 30 30 1
wait 3
expect raining yes
quit
